ting Date 07/09/2025 Closing Date Open Until Filled No Special Instructions Summary Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Resume Transcripts Cover Letter Optional Documents Statement of Teaching Philosophy MAIN CAMPUS One University Parkway Romeoville, IL 60446-2200 (815) 838-0500 (800) 897-9000 Lewis University is authorized to operate as a postsecondary educational institution by the Illinois Board of Higher Education . © 2025 Lewis University. All rights reserved. Email Webmaster ¿ Habla Español ? Site Index To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
