 Qualifications -Experience as a preceptor or clinical educator -Teaching experience as a clinical and/or faculty instructor in a respiratory therapy program Essential Duties Work hours Part-time; as needed basis;; approximately 7 hours per week Posting Detail Information Posting Number F00428 Posting Date Closing Date Open Until Filled No Special Instructions Summary Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Applicant Documents Required Documents Transcripts Resume Cover Letter Optional Documents MAIN CAMPUS One University Parkway Romeoville, IL 60446-2200 (815) 838-0500 (800) 897-9000 Lewis University is authorized to operate as a postsecondary educational institution by the Illinois Board of Higher Education . © 2025 Lewis University. All rights reserved. Email Webmaster ¿ Habla Español ? Site Index To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
